	<!--
	  .NET-Framework-only sections (system.transactions / system.diagnostics / system.net /
	  system.web) and the <runtime> assemblyBinding redirects were removed: on net8.0 the
	  System.Configuration.ConfigurationManager has no handlers for them, so SpecFlow's
	  ConfigurationManager.GetSection(...) failed with "Configuration system failed to
	  initialize" in AssemblyInitialize. They are no-ops on .NET 8 (binding redirects are
	  ignored; there is no ASP.NET membership/roleManager). appSettings / connectionStrings /
	  secureSettings are retained because the tests read them.
	-->
